49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"纯文字提示\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"不显示类型图标。\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> icon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> data-testid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"alert-close-count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>累计关闭 {</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()} 次&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"由调用方决定是否渲染\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> setShow</span><span style=\"